/-!
# A050425

Numbers for which in base 2 the least number of digits that can be removed to leave a base 2 palindromic number (beginning with 1) is 1.

The 60 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A050425

